            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[New: Vela updates itself while you are not using it, and says so on its card.
Fixed: The countdown in the menu bar no longer goes blank during a meeting, or runs late after sleep.
Fixed: Undo leaves alone an event you have changed elsewhere since, and says so.
Better: Settings says what leaves this Mac: places you type go to Apple Maps.
]]></description>
